    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Instrument Training.</strong> You gain proficiency with three Musical Instruments of your choice.</p><p><strong>Encouraging Song.</strong> As you finish a Short or Long Rest, you can play a song on a Musical Instrument you have proficiency with and give Heroic Inspiration to allies who hear the song. You can affect a number of allies equal to your Proficiency Bonus.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-4eQUdmoOxA8uNbfX\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Give Heroic Inspiration on the sheets of the allies who hear the song.</p></section>",
